---
description: Sequential phase planning for projects and major implementations
alwaysApply: true
---

For a new project or major multi-system change, activate `/instructions/PROJECT_PLANNING.md` and `/instructions/ROLES.md`. Create `docs/plans/phase_0_foundations_plan.md` plus a `docs/workstreams/<task-id>/manifest.md` with required/skipped roles and stage gates before implementation. Generate exactly one later phase plan after each verified completion. Consolidate remaining human-only actions and environment-variable names into the final implementation checklist.
